# The netCI Go image (Dockerfile at the root) uses this allow-list, through BuildKit's per-Dockerfile
# ignore file; .dockerignore is the IDP images' (backend, worker), which build from the root too.
# An allow-list: the image needs the two binaries and nothing else. Everything not named here
# never reaches the Docker daemon -- notably .netci-gate, where the lab's secrets live.
*
!bin/linux-amd64/cell-agent
!bin/linux-amd64/supervisor
!bin/linux-amd64/netci-queue
!bin/linux-amd64/netci-fabric
!bin/linux-amd64/netci-sandbox
